*> vybe-test: cobol/binary_comp_types/binary_comp3_high_precision_decimal
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_binary_comp_types.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 A PIC 9(7)V9(4) COMP-3 VALUE 1234567.1234.
01 B PIC 9(7)V9(4) COMP-3 VALUE 0001.0001.
01 R PIC 9(9)V9(4) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    ADD A B GIVING R.
    DISPLAY R.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING R DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "1234568.1235"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [1234568.1235] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

